{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"centers\": [\n    {\n      \"options\": [\n        \"昂首前行的人始终被旧梦牵扯。\",\n        \"向前的脚步一直被往事拉住。\",\n        \"旧梦始终牵着挺直腰杆的行路人。\"\n      ],\n      \"center\": \"昂首前行的人始终被旧梦牵扯。\",\n      \"distinct_because\": \"核心是向前行动与旧梦牵扯同时持续，而非单纯怀旧、身体衰弱或最终战胜悲伤。昂首前行并未停止，旧梦也未消失。濒死与精神自救只是这一关系的特殊处境，不另立同构的Center。\",\n      \"basis\": \"A中18份的主要共识：失去后的尊严与回忆持续拉扯；B中DD的解释力96%、说服力9.5，且没有无法解释的段落，A1进一步支持前行与往事的关系；C明确指出向外行动与向内牵动同时成立、彼此牵制。保留持续关系，去掉心理动词、自我判断与结局。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0cb399b0-f897-46da-acc8-29ec6f817dd1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261021T175206729570Z", "elapsed_seconds": 110.109, "completed_utc": "2026-10-21T17:53:56.839989+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f8b036e6571402bb2d2b45161fac5f98e8a4c691f569e18e6132096a1cd54895", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "